OL,3,ABurnham calls summit of Welsh, Scottish
OL,4,Aand Northern Irish first ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says he will bring
OL,7,Ftogether the leaders of Wales, Scotland
OL,8,Fand Northern Ireland this autumn for a
OL,9,Fsummit to help boost the UK economy.
OL,11,FHe made the announcement on a visit to
OL,12,FTata steelworks in Port Talbot - his
OL,13,Ffirst official visit to Wales - where
OL,14,Fhe met workers, apprentices and senior
OL,15,Fexecutives.
OL,17,FHe also suggested Wales and Scotland
OL,18,Fconsider ways to deepen devolution by
OL,19,Ffollowing England's model where more
OL,20,Fpowers are given to cities and regions
OL,21,Funder mayors.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
