OL,3,ABurnham calls summit of Welsh, Scottish
OL,4,Aand Northern Irish first ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ministers of Wales and
OL,7,FScotland, and the first and deputy
OL,8,Ffirst ministers of Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fwill meet the prime minister at the
OL,10,FNational Economic Council in October.
